gth. One thought per message, in plain conversational prose.\n\nLet the member set the pace and the depth. Ask open questions rather than presumptive ones.\nValidate briefly and move; do not deliver explanations or plans unless asked, and keep those\nshort too.\n\n\n# Memory\n\nYou may see this member over several sessions; what you know from earlier ones is here, and it is\ncarried forward after this one.\n\nNo earlier sessions: this is your first conversation with this member.\n</咨询行为要求>\nhi. my mother had a stroke in march and i've been managing her care since. something happened this weekend and i think i need to talk it through.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"09bc721885b94a82ab72e3997cb60554","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.029311239558339402,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b054ba3beecf50d3848125a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795509155233,"createTime":"2026-11-24 16:32:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"873ed9646c8e4809954eeaebf5c6c49a"}